# My Sandbox
Welcome to my sandbox! This page showcases the projects developed in my workspace at [/sandbox/gaquino/]().

Currently, my work focuses on two main research topics using Basilisk:

The interaction between vortex rings and particle(s).

The simulation of stratified exchange flows.

-*Guilherme Siqueira de Aquino*- 

## Physical Systems 
#### Vortex Ring and Particle(s)
###### Interaction regimes of a vortex ring and an inertial particle
Study of the dynamics of a single inertial particle interacting with a vortex ring, modeled using a point-like one-way coupling approach.




###### Vortex Ring and Multi Particles


#### Stratified Exchange Flows
Numerical simulations of stratified inclined duct flows, employing a width-averaged approach using the parametrization of side-wall effects derived from three-dimensional semi-analytical solutions. 

